s 142 different awardees. Contract [1], for 14,950 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar distribution occurs in other contract types. The number of awardees does not prove any single contract was improperly awarded.\nWhat can be checked: Check if multiple contracts in December cover the same need. Review awardee A's contracts to see if they repeat the same services. Contract [1] shows a near-limit amount in December, which may reflect market rates or budget constraints.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["BG6761I1ZUW5HQrHoP3G5A%3D%3D","d0cD1KdbpVPpxJFXpLZ%2B2A%3D%3D","7DDYhUMs%2F55PpzdqOdhuWg%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}